.el .ds Aq '
.TH quarters-import 1  "quarters-import " 
.SH NAME
quarters\-import \- Authenticate a bundle and import it as a fresh template
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquarters\-import\fR [\fB\-\-preview\fR] [\fB\-\-confirm\-plan\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-key\fR> <\fIBUNDLE\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Authenticate a bundle and import it as a fresh template
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Absolute private 32\-byte key file in a protected directory outside the Quarters store
.TP
\fB\-\-preview\fR
Authenticate and return the exact plan digest without mutation
.TP
\fB\-\-confirm\-plan\fR \fI<DIGEST>\fR
Execute only the exact digest returned by preview
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBUNDLE\fR>
Absolute path to one authenticated bundle
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
New local template display name
